  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ensuring capacity for human rights defenders to promote accountability</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is improved security and protection og human rights defenders. The expected outcome for the target groups of the Project are: Human rights defenders (HRDs) effectivly mitigate threats and risks when they arise; Improved accountability mechanisms on violation against HRDs; Evidence and legal cases are better documented and accessible to accountability and investigation mechanisms.</narrative>
  </description>
